<% content_for(:title) { "首页 · 轻遇" } %>

<div class="mx-auto flex min-h-screen w-full max-w-md flex-col px-6 py-8">
  <header class="flex items-center justify-between">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <div class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-400 to-emerald-500 text-lg font-bold text-white">轻</div>
      <span class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">轻遇</span>
    </div>
    <%= button_to "退出登录", session_path, method: :delete,
          class: "cursor-pointer rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-gray-500 transition hover:bg-gray-100" %>
  </header>

  <main class="mt-10 flex-1">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Hi，<%= current_user.display_name %> 👋</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-gray-500">这里将是你的实名认证与每日精选推荐入口。</p>

    <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 text-center">
      <div class="mx-auto flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-teal-50 text-teal-600">🔒</div>
      <p class="mt-3 font-medium text-gray-700">实名认证</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-400">即将上线：身份证 + 学信网核验</p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <p class="mt-8 text-center text-xs text-gray-400">M1 · 账号体系已就绪，认证 / 推荐 / 聊天依次接入</p>
</div>
